      "title": "CHALET: Planned Acquisition And Capital Raise Will Support Future Upside Potential",
      "body": "Analysts have trimmed their price target for Chalet Hotels from ₹1,103.25 to ₹992.62, citing updated assumptions on revenue growth, profit margins, and future P/E levels. What's in the News A board meeting is scheduled on April 24, 2026 at 10:30 IST to consider approval of the acquisition of Seasons Hotels Private Limited.",
