      "title": "CHALET: Udaipur Resort Expansion And New CEO Will Drive Future Upside",
      "body": "Analysts have trimmed their price target for Chalet Hotels slightly to reflect an updated fair value of ₹1,103.71, based on modest adjustments to the discount rate, revenue growth, profit margin and future P/E assumptions. What's in the News CEO transition: Dr. Sanjay Sethi completed his term as CEO and retired from executive responsibilities on January 31, 2026, and continues with the company as a non executive director, with the Board recording appreciation for his leadership and service (company filing).",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
